    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="privacy_statement_body">Car Motion Sickness Aid works entirely on your device. Motion sensor readings are used live to move the cues and are never stored or sent anywhere. There\'s no account, no analytics and no internet access. Vehicle detection, if you turn it on, is provided on-device by Google Play services.</string>
